Different people have different strategies, but I usually try to level
up as slowly as I can until I find good armor. The difficulty of
monsters increase dramatically every Exp level for the first few levels;
usually I try to get at least AC:0 before getting to Exp:5 (not always
possible, but I try). Of course, for ants, this means staying at Exp:1
for a while... may not always be practical, but if you let your pet do
the killing, by the time you meet ants your pet should be buff enough to
take them out while you stand on an E-word.


